<title>HONG KONG: Bankers Trust sets warrants on SHK Prop.</title>
<headline>Bankers Trust sets warrants on SHK Prop.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bankers Trust International Plc said on Wednesday it has launched 40 million American-style call warrants on shares of Sun Hung Kai Properties Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	 HK$99.225   PREMIUM  18.37 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	  HK$1.323    GEARING  7.181X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	   15.JAN.98   PAYDATE  2 TO 3 WKS AFTER LAUNCH</p>
<p> LISTING		HONG KONG   EXER LOT 10,000</p>
<p> REFERENCE SPOT     HK$94.50</p>
<p> GOVERNING LAW	HONG KONG</p>
<p> NOTE		   PHYSICAL SHARES OR CASH ALTERNATIVE AT</p>
<p>			  ISSUER'S DISCRETION</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
